    "biography": "<p>Patricia Okonedo runs \"Pat's Cycle Repairs\" under the railway arches on Morning Lane: half honest bike shop, half the biggest bike-theft ring in E8. She is everyone's auntie and nobody's fool. She pays cash, on the nail, and never forgets a debt.</p><p>She knows every bicycle in the borough, including the ones she has not seen yet. Tea before business. Cash after inspection.</p><p>Pat wants a crew that earns quietly. She can source tools, buy stolen bicycles and set orders through the Blower. She expects loyalty, not cruelty.</p>"
   },
