    "biography": "<p>Pat's mechanic. Can strip a stolen road bike to unrecognisable parts in eleven minutes. Speaks mostly in derailleur.</p><p>Workshop mechanic, dry wit, permanent mug of tea.</p><p>Spanner repairs the crew\u2019s kit and notices mismatched stories as readily as mismatched wheels. He knows Jaz is better than the work she is doing.</p>"
