    "biography": "<p>Pat's nephew, twenty, permanently on a BMX. Kez scouts the bikes \u2014 which lock, which street, how long until the owner comes back \u2014 and texts you tip-offs.</p><p>A sharp-eyed runner whose phone is always vibrating.</p><p>Kez trades information: where the bikes are, which road is closed, who is suddenly spending money. Treat them as a person with ambitions, not an infallible quest marker.</p>"
